         │        │  └─ project (w) (rows≈4 cost≈64)
         │        │     └─ source wide AS wide (rows≈4 cost≈32)
         │        └─ project (b) (rows≈4 cost≈128)
         │           └─ project (b) (rows≈4 cost≈64)
         │              └─ source wide AS wide_1 (rows≈4 cost≈32)
         └─ project (col0) (rows≈8 cost≈512)
            └─ project (v.w) (rows≈8 cost≈384)
               └─ union-all (rows≈8 cost≈256)
                  ├─ project (w) (rows≈4 cost≈128)
